+                  f"{note}", flush=True)
+        # patches/0290: GLM53_TF_KV_POOL_TOKENS / _PAGE / _SLACK decide where rows live and the admission policy (rank
+        # 0 plans, rank 1 follows it with a pool of its own): both ranks must agree
